Complete corresponding source code: https://github.com/zillazero/foxfin

Changes made for Foxfin (2026-10-12, FOX / pk187):
- Renamed to "Foxfin", application id site.pk187.foxfin, new icon, TV banner
  and logos from the FOX Designsystem.
- Replaced the built-in Moonfin/Neon Pulse/Glass/8-Bit Hero themes with the five
  FOX Designsystem themes (Foxhole default, Magenta, Amber, Gruen, Polizei),
  selectable per user/device in Settings > Appearance.
- Removed Firebase (firebase_core, firebase_messaging, google-services); push
  notifications are disabled.
- Removed Discord and donation links; source/issue/license links point to the
  Foxfin repository; update check points to the Foxfin repository and is
  skipped when installed via the FOX Store.
- No server addresses or credentials are preconfigured.

Changes in Foxfin 2.7.1 (2026-10-13):
- Trakt and Simkl integration (lib/integrations/tracking): OAuth device/PIN
  login per server user, scrobbling (start/pause/stop), two-way watched sync,
  watchlist <-> favourites sync, resume points ("continue watching") from
  Trakt/Simkl into Jellyfin.
- Direct TMDB fallback for episode/season ratings when the Moonfin server
  plugin is not installed.
- API keys are supplied at build time via --dart-define-from-file
  (foxfin-keys.json, never committed). Services without a key are hidden.

Changes in Foxfin 2.7.2 (2026-10-13):
- FOX account: sign-in through the FOX Store (SSO, signature permission
  site.pk187.permission.SSO) using the bundled FOX SSO client
  (android/app/src/main/kotlin/site/pk187/sso, MethodChannel "fox_sso").
- Sync with the FOX account: theme, favourites and playback progress (shop
  Jellyfin watch.pk187.site only, server_id 37f9a5dd4a4e49fba3dc493068b2397d;
  private servers are never uploaded) and Trakt/Simkl link status (no tokens).
- Accepts "Filme ansehen" links from the FOX Store (https://watch.pk187.site/...).
- android:allowBackup="false" so tokens never land in backups.

Changes in Foxfin 2.8.3 (2026-10-24):
- D-Pad focus guard (lib/fox/fox_focus_guard.dart), FOX page transitions,
  distinct "Reduziert" animation level, stick cache default 150 MB,
  configurable home metadata cache duration, mpv GPU upscaling.
- Bundled third-party shaders (assets/shaders/), both MIT licensed:
  * AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0 (FSR.glsl), mpv port by agyild,
    Copyright (c) 2021 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. – MIT License.
  * Anime4K by bloc97 (Anime4K_*.glsl), Copyright (c) 2019 bloc97 – MIT
    License, see assets/shaders/LICENSE-Anime4K.txt.

Changes in Foxfin 2.8.4 (2026-10-24):
- Home: "Weiterschauen" and "Als Nächstes" first in the default layout;
  static skeleton placeholders on weak devices / with effects off.
- First-start navigation per device: sidebar on TV and tablet, bottom bar
  on phones (explicit choices are kept).
- Sidebar: smoother expand, FOX accent edge, glass off with effects off.

Foxfin 2.8.5: Video-Sleep-Timer, Einstellungs-Sicherung (ohne Geheimnisse),
"Im FOX-Player öffnen" (Fallback FOX Store), FOX-Zeilenköpfe und Akzent-Fokus-Glow.

Foxfin 2.9.0: lokales Ausblenden von Titeln, FFmpeg/Tunneling in FOX-Einstellungen,
Logo A (Foxhole). Funktionen eigenständig implementiert, kein Fremdcode übernommen.
